sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(React SPA)
    participant BFF as Express BFF<br/>8080/TCP
    participant GitHub as GitHub API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GIQ as GKE Recommender API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Browser,GIQ: Flow 1: Benchmark Result Submission

    Browser->>BFF: POST /api/results<br/>HTTPS/443 (Cloud Run TLS)<br/>X-Prism-Github-Token header
    BFF->>GitHub: GET /user<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (GitHub token)
    GitHub-->>BFF: User profile + username
    BFF->>GitHub: GET /orgs/llm-d/memberships/:user<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (GitHub token)
    GitHub-->>BFF: Org membership + role
    BFF->>GCS: GET prism-iam/allowlists<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (ADC)
    GCS-->>BFF: Allowlist entries
    Note over BFF: Resolve permission:<br/>highest of org role,<br/>admin allowlist, user allowlist
    BFF->>GCS: PUT results-store/:uuid<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (ADC)<br/>Custom metadata: github_user, state=staged
    GCS-->>BFF: Upload confirmation
    BFF-->>Browser: 201 Created + result metadata

    Note over Browser,GIQ: Flow 2: Dashboard Data Load (GIQ Proxy)

    Browser->>BFF: GET /api/giq/*<br/>HTTPS/443 (Cloud Run TLS)<br/>Optional Bearer token
    BFF->>GIQ: GET /*<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (ADC or user token)
    GIQ-->>BFF: Inference quality data
    BFF-->>Browser: JSON response

    Note over Browser,GIQ: Flow 3: GCS Benchmark Data Read

    Browser->>BFF: GET /api/gcs/*<br/>HTTPS/443 (Cloud Run TLS)<br/>GitHub token (optional)
    BFF->>GCS: GET benchmark objects<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.2+<br/>Bearer (ADC)
    GCS-->>BFF: Benchmark data
    Note over BFF: Filter results by<br/>ownership + approval state<br/>for non-admin users
    BFF-->>Browser: Filtered JSON response
